#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/022/HeaVnc109_02239:TEXT_HEAVNC109_02239_SYSTEM_000_130:1"
msgid "You have learned the emote <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Victory</ui-edge-color></ui-color>!"
msgstr "Вы выучили эмоцию «<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ликовать</ui-edge-color></ui-color>»!"
